page|Turn knob|You try to turn the knob. Roll a die.
	pass|@backdoorLockedPass
	fail|@backdoorLockedFail
	toc|The door looks larger and more solid from in here. <i>Maybe it's unlocked?</i> you wonder to yourself.
	
page|Shake door|You grab the knob again and begin shaking it violently. Roll a die.
	pass|@backdoorLockedPass
	fail|@backdoorLockedFail
	toc|Well, now you know it's locked:  no matter how hard you try, the knob just won't turn. Looking closer, there is a little light getting through between the door and its jam. <i>Maybe I can shake open?<i>
	
page|Hit door|You muster up your strength and prepare to bash the door down with your shoulder. Roll a die.
	pass|@backdoorLockedPass
	fail|@backdoorLockedFail
	toc|No matter how hard you shake, the door doesn't budge. And you might have pulled something in your right arm. Maybe you can knock it down? You also begin to wonder if you shouldn't move on.
	
page|Pick lock|You get a sharp pain stabs you in the shoulder; take 1 facedown damage ({strength} negates).\n\nAs you stick the hairpin into the lock, you wonder why it was in your pocket. Roll a die.
	pass|@backdoorLockedPass
	fail|@backdoorLockedFail
	toc|The third or fourth time you hit door, something in your shoulder pops and it hurts. Bad. You feel the panic setting in. Why won't this door open? "Hey, is this a hairpin?" you ask out loud.
	
page|Unlock door|You pull out the key and look at for a moment before putting it into the lock. Roll a die. 
	pass|@backdoorLockedPass
	fail|@backdoorLockedFail
	toc|The lock doesn't move and, eventually, the hairpin bends too much to be of use. <i>Maybe this really is a waste of time,</> you consider. <i>Wait, I have that key." If you have the {c:QItemBrassKey}, ...

end|Well, you try to put the key into the lock but it doesn't fit. You look at the key and try again. And again. And again. Dejected and out of ideas, you turn away from the door. "I guess we'll have to find another way out," you say to no one in particular.
